                <paragraph><strong>Basic usage</strong></paragraph>
                <paragraph><reference internal="1" refid="hydra_zen.get_target" reftitle="hydra_zen.get_target"><literal classes="xref py py-obj">get_target</literal></reference> works on all variety of configs produced by <reference internal="1" reftitle="hydra_zen.builds" refuri="hydra_zen.builds#hydra_zen.builds"><literal classes="xref py py-obj">builds</literal></reference> and
                    <reference internal="1" reftitle="hydra_zen.just" refuri="hydra_zen.just#hydra_zen.just"><literal classes="xref py py-obj">just</literal></reference>.</paragraph>
                <doctest_block classes="doctest" xml:space="preserve">&gt;&gt;&gt; from hydra_zen import builds, just, get_target
&gt;&gt;&gt; get_target(builds(int))
